{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach it, grab it and move to destination. Perform task at destination or scan environment. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanEnvironment    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbed    /> <Condition ID = IsAtTaskLocation    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    />\"",
